  upgradeCosts: 05000000070000000a00000007000000
  upgradeDescription: Emboldens our allies and increases their viciousness.
  upgradeDescriptions:
  - 'Do you think the Oodler would be jealous?

    <b>Cooldown: 15->10</b>'
  - "Heh, vicious little weevils aren\u2019t they?\n<b>Heal: 30% -> 60%</b>"
  - 'Yes, my minions ATTACK - ATTACK I SAY!

    <b>Buff: 200% -> 250%</b>'
  - 'They grow up so fast *wipes tear*

    <b>Buff Duration: 5 -> 7</b>'
  cooldownReduction: 5
  lvl1Buff: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ff13998205b6484aa2843bde6d9d0b4, type: 2}
  lvl2Buff: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3ee7ae716e687224fb4c4a713cc881f1, type: 2}
  lvl3Buff: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 621bc5b24b9b4c544a5dda8851dc9b06, type: 2}
  lvl4Buff: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a2a14df6f456f7a4ba264dd6c33ad04b, type: 2}
--- !u!114 &4806051205141015411
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
